  "description": "Trumpf.Coparoo.Waiting.WinForms provides Windows Forms-based visual waiting dialogs for automated tests. This package extends Trumpf.Coparoo.Waiting with interactive UI overlays that show the current state of test conditions in real-time. The dialogs turn red for false conditions, green when conditions are true, and grey to indicate when manual intervention is required. Windows-only package.",
